[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 39381.26, "timestamp": "10:56:21", "text": "？當然，我們還沒說F of Holling呢。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 39397.03, "timestamp": "10:56:37", "text": "我拿到了四個積分，呃，這次的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 39400.39, "timestamp": "10:56:40", "text": "。積分快用完了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 39411.03, "timestamp": "10:56:51", "text": "。這不會來了。呃，我會等的。任務已接受。復興之路"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 39414.74, "timestamp": "10:56:54", "text": "。好的。支線任務。"}]